@startuml
title Built visitor path — static platform catalog
actor Visitor
participant "website/index.html" as HTML
participant "website/css/landing.css" as CSS
participant "website/js/main.js (read-only)" as JS
Visitor -> HTML : Open landing page / #platform
HTML -> CSS : product-grid / product-card DOM classes
CSS --> Visitor : Existing responsive card surfaces
HTML -> JS : Existing revealEls registration
Visitor -> JS : Scroll platform cards into viewport
JS -> CSS : revealObserver adds visible
CSS --> Visitor : Existing revealed product cards
opt Existing mobile navigation neighbor
  Visitor -> JS : Click navToggle / navLinks
  JS -> CSS : Toggle / remove active and open
  CSS --> Visitor : Existing mobile menu state
end
note over HTML,JS
No ASPIDA runtime, checkout or Android path is simulated.
end note
@enduml
